  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_a52640173a02437eb67ea5c0d7c6de30",
      "statement": "连续播放的转场由 `ended` 处理器分流：仅当 `isLoopMode` 为假且 `playModeSelect.value !== 'stop-after'` 时，才先 `pOpenTransition(pFrom, pTo)` 开转场再调用 `playNext()`；`loop` 模式只把 `currentTime` 归零重播当前曲，`stop-after` 模式直接换曲不起转场，因此 `pstats.trans` 统计的是曲目切换次数而不是播完次数。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://js/musicplayer.js#L146-L155",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8682e018625bda6c86d96dff7234858c46da5d8179cde7e6383cf85cc0f3a219:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://js/musicplayer.js#L157-L173",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f9b78bf604cb7e8b657bd3cdbb83b5beb967b60d69e348fa14c372c8a01a2412:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e62cd96b0c914b10bd2a4087c5899c09",
      "statement": "`playNext()` 的同步函数体顺序即契约：推进并回绕下标、置 `pPlayIntent = true` 与 `pErrHeal = 0`、设 `musicPlayer.src`、`tryPlay('next')`、`pSetSessionMeta`、`pArmZeroDur`、最后写 `_currentMusic` 与新下标并把 `_currentTime` 写 0；其中写 0 是转场成功判据能成立的前提，因为 `loadedmetadata` 会从 `_currentTime` 恢复播放头，残留旧秒数会让未出声的加载被误判为成功。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://js/musicplayer.js#L116-L144",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:884fe9576c8501ec9af94d527206bd5ad9e19e470fc771a7696c7f75c88b8eb7:"
