    {
      "id": "claim_796dc06401f54b5ba974792115550de2",
      "statement": "`pOpenTransition`/`pCloseTransition`/`pDiscardTransition` 定义了转场的四种结局：成功累加 `pstats.ok`、失败按 reason 累加 `pstats.fail` 与 `pstats.reasons`、开新转场时旧转场按 `superseded` 失败结算、用户主动换曲或停止则 `pstats.trans--` 且不写 ok/fail。",
      "evidence": [
